# Allowlist: the image is built from the package source only. Everything else in the
# working folder (the portfolio database and its backups, my_*.json records, cached
# bars, results, every .env file) stays out of the build context, Git-ignored or not.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!main.py
!cli/
!tradingagents/

# Never ship these, even if they turn up inside an allowed folder.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.db
**/*.duckdb
**/*.parquet
**/backups
**/my_*.json
**/paper_tracker*.json
**/data_cache
**/results
**/recommendations
**/bars
